## Thin Shell residual SoT (Phases 4bu–4bz)

Post–Gap Closure thin-shell honesty locks live in dedicated Markdoc SoTs under `docs/dev/`. This charter does **not** re-open product binders or raise budgets; it points merge reviewers at the active inventories.

### Dual-SOT covenant

**Dual-SOT covenant:** packaging keys and `WorkspacePluginCapabilities` slots must stay consistent. Capability-stub codegen alone must not “enable” a surface that packaging does not declare (and the reverse). Rules + inventory: [`thin-shell-dual-sot-derivation.mdoc`](./thin-shell-dual-sot-derivation.mdoc) (Phase **4bu**). Consistency proofs: `apps/web/test/thin-shell-dual-sot-derivation.spec.ts`.

